  s3 --> s4: a card log or conversation update commits
  s3 --> s5: HTTP 2xx acknowledges the revision sent
  s4 --> s2: receiver refuses, disconnects or times out or receiver accepts but its response is lost or HTTP 2xx acknowledges the revision sent
  s4 --> s1: the board stops before acknowledgment
